        "/Alternate_Name": "DS5319",
        "/Title": "Datasheet - STM32F103x8 STM32F103xB - Medium-density performance line Arm<Sup>®</Sup>-based 32-bit MCU with 64 or 128 KB Flash, USB, CAN, 7 timers, 2 ADCs, 9 com. interfaces",
